          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What You'll Walk Away With -->
  <section class="border-t border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-32">
      <p
        class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest"
      >
        The outcome
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-heading md:text-4xl">
        What you'll walk away with
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div
          class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift"
        >
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-line bg-stone">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-forest" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 01-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 017.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 00-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0112 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0121 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0112 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 013 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl text-heading">
            A live, deployed website
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            Not a mockup or a localhost demo. A real website on a custom domain,
            live on the internet, ready to share with clients and prospects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift"
        >
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-line bg-stone">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-forest" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75L22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3l-4.5 16.5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl text-heading">
            Your own GitHub knowledge base
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            Every file, every change, every version tracked in GitHub. Claude Code
            uses this history to make smarter suggestions every time you work on your site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift"
        >
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-line bg-stone">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-forest" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182m0-4.991v4.99" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl text-heading">
            A repeatable system
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            The workflow for updating your site on your own &mdash; add pages, change
            copy, swap images, fix bugs &mdash; all by talking to Claude Code.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Watch the walkthrough: video embed -->
  <section id="video" class="border-t border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-32">
      <p
        class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest"
      >
        Watch the walkthrough
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-heading md:text-4xl">
        See the full masterclass
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
        Watch the complete recording below &mdash; the full walkthrough from zero to a live website.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper">
        <div class="relative aspect-video w-full">
          <iframe
            class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/5iyJWn5BFkY"
            title="Build a Website with Claude Code, AI Masterclass"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            allowfullscreen
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Download the Free Guide -->
  <section id="download" class="border-t border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <p
          class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest"
        >
          Free resource
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-heading md:text-4xl">
          Download the Free Guide
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
          Get the step-by-step PDF companion to the masterclass. Everything you need
          to build your first website with Claude Code &mdash; on your own schedule.
        </p>

        <!-- PDF DOWNLOAD: Replace # with your PDF link or form action -->
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a
            href="https://gamma.app/docs/Before-the-Masterclass-Get-Claude-Code-Running-in-Your-Terminal-jjate7ewkbeny5m"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-block rounded-full bg-forest px-8 py-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-heading transition-all hover:bg-forest-hover"
