  <!-- About the Instructor -->
  <section class="border-t border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <p
          class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest"
        >
          Your instructor
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-heading md:text-4xl">
          Warren Kucker
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
          Warren is the founder of Basiq Consulting, where he helps companies go
          from AI-curious to AI-native across engineering, operations, and go-to-market.
          He's also the host of the Selling AI Podcast, where he breaks down how
          businesses are actually using AI to grow &mdash; not just talking about it.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
          This masterclass comes from building dozens of production websites with
          Claude Code &mdash; and teaching non-technical founders how to do the same.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-body">Basiq Consulting</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-body">Selling AI Podcast</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-body">AI Strategy</span>
        </div>
