          <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            No. This masterclass is designed for non-technical founders and operators.
            Claude Code writes the code for you &mdash; you just need to describe what
            you want in plain English.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-heading">
            What does this cost?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            The masterclass recording and guide are free. Claude Code requires an
            Anthropic subscription (around $20/month). Vercel hosting is free for
            personal sites. A custom domain runs about $12/year.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-heading">
