            forms, blog integration, and professional-grade performance. Not a
            drag-and-drop template &mdash; a real codebase you own and control.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-heading">
            How long does it take?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            You can have a live, deployed website in a single afternoon. The masterclass
            walks you through the entire process from zero to live in about 90 minutes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related Webinars -->
  <section class="border-t border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-32">
      <p
        class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest"
      >
        Up next
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-heading md:text-4xl">
        Related Webinars
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
        Part of a series of hands-on AI webinars from Basiq Consulting. More sessions are coming soon.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
